{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53272","headline":"诗偈 九十七 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 九十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世人重珍宝（《宗镜录》卷十五作「但重金」），我贵（《宗镜录》作「爱」）刹那静。\n金多乱人心，静见真如性。\n性空法亦空（《宗镜录》作「性通法亦通」），十八绝（《宗镜录》作「断」）行踪。\n但自心无碍。\n何愁神（《宗镜录》作「声」）不通。\n（《法藏碎金录》卷四、卷五录前四句）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}